# EXPRESS-007 manual requests.
# 1. Start the server: npm run dev:express:7  (starts with products p1 … p8)
# 2. Click "Send Request" above a request (VS Code extension "REST Client").

@host = http://localhost:3000

### No sort (expect 200, p1 … p8)
GET {{host}}/products

### Cheapest first (expect 200, p4 p7 p5 p3 p6 p2 p1 p8)
GET {{host}}/products?sort=price

### Most expensive first (expect 200, p8 p1 p2 p3 p6 p5 p7 p4)
GET {{host}}/products?sort=-price

### Best rated first (expect 200, p8 p1 p4 p5 p6 p2 p3 p7)
GET {{host}}/products?sort=-rating

### By name A-Z (expect 200, p6 p5 p3 p2 p8 p1 p7 p4)
GET {{host}}/products?sort=name

### Invalid sort (expect 400)
GET {{host}}/products?sort=popularity
